{"2833360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kitty Kitty Bounce Bounce", "steam_appid": 2833360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitty Kitty</strong> is a series of good old-fashioned arcade ever-green games with some cute little twists to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Bounce</strong> is a block-breaker with a linear story about the protagonist - Kitty. This time you get to learn Kitty's relationship with his human and take part in some of Kitty's adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce around, break some blocks, and learn Kitty's story - each Kitty has their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ different levels to beat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accessibility options such as: dimming the background, changing the size of the font, etc.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > various difficulty levels, suitable for those who like to progress in a story carefree, and those who prefer PAIN!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > in-game shop with possibilities to buy health and different paddles in exchange for points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hand-drawn graphics!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As much as this game can seem cute and innocent, I DID put some content that might be distressing or viewed as inappropriate/scary for children, so maybe don't put it on for your charge to get rid of them from the room completely. I'm just saying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitty Kitty</strong> is a series of good old-fashioned arcade ever-green games with some cute little twists to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Bounce</strong> is a block-breaker with a linear story about the protagonist - Kitty. This time you get to learn Kitty's relationship with his human and take part in some of Kitty's adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce around, break some blocks, and learn Kitty's story - each Kitty has their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ different levels to beat! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >accessibility options such as: dimming the background, changing the size of the font, etc.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > various difficulty levels, suitable for those who like to progress in a story carefree, and those who prefer PAIN!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > in-game shop with possibilities to buy health and different paddles in exchange for points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hand-drawn graphics!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As much as this game can seem cute and innocent, I DID put some content that might be distressing or viewed as inappropriate/scary for children, so maybe don't put it on for your charge to get rid of them from the room completely. I'm just saying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/extras/f12dfcd361c03a78b87f2c509d273efd.webp?t=1788188103\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Good old-fashioned arcade game in which you bop around a kitty using various cushions. Your goal is to break all breakable block without falling onto the floor. Learn each Kitty's story - beware, though, because even the silliest adventures finally end.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/1351c556d4557bed40b40231f85bce287699f2b3/header.jpg?t=1788188103", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833360/4cc48ba515272bace6f7fd79e11a49f7396cabd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788188103", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co